# Sapph — App Overview

Sapph is a queer dating/friendship app. The frontend is **React + Vite**. The native iOS app wraps the web app via **Capacitor**, loading content from the live Firebase Hosting URL (`https://sapph-b4f8e.web.app`) — so web deployments update the native app automatically (no App Store build needed for most changes).

## Tech Stack

- **React + Vite** (JSX, no TypeScript)
- **Firebase Firestore** — all data storage
- **Firebase Storage** — profile photo uploads
- **Firebase Hosting** — web deployment (`firebase deploy --only hosting`)
- **Capacitor** — iOS/Android native wrapper
- **react-router-dom** — routing (lazy-loaded pages, `ProtectedRoute`)
- **@dnd-kit** — drag-and-drop for photo reordering

